{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1159002-sympathetic-casting-too-easy","id":1159002,"title":"Sympathetic Casting Too Easy?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-11-15T09:51:22-08:00","id":1159002,"title":"Sympathetic Casting Too Easy?","content":"What do you guys think?<br /> <br /> It's pretty easy to get Weak Sympathy and 3 or 4 Withstand is not really that hard to overcome and Symbolic Sympathetic Yantras are easy to obtain.<br /> <br /> A starting Space Mage with a Scrying Rote +3 can get 1 + 3 + 3 = 7 + 3 WP = 10 dice -6 to bump potency to 6 = 4 dice. You need to 1 reach for Sensory, 1 to change Primary to Potency and 1 for Advanced Duration so there's no Paradox either.<br /> <br /> A starting Mastigos can pretty much Scry on anyone he's met if he takes Matter as a third Arcana to move ink on a page to make a representation of his own memories.<br /> <br /> Once the one-way Scrying window is open he can pretty much nuke to his heart's content.<br /> <br /> I'm wondering if this is a little too easy now...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1470,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1470-johnny-awesome","user":"Johnny Awesome","date":".  Meant to write Advanced Duration, not Potency 11-15-2017, 01:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1470-johnny-awesome","name":"Johnny Awesome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1470_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"447"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T10:02:37-08:00","id":1159015,"title":"","content":"Remove the Reach for Advanced Potency and add a Reach for Sympathetic Range, and it seems to work out. Just remember that doing this on mages can extremely dangerous since sympathetic casting can be tracked just as easily as any other type of casting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T10:19:41-08:00","id":1159035,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Johnny Awesome</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1159002-sympathetic-casting-too-easy#post1159002\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's pretty easy to get Weak Sympathy</div> </div> </div> </div>Casual acquaintances aren't quite the same thing as random people on the street or even people you happen to know, and using secondhand sympathies takes up another spell.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> You need to 1 reach for Sensory, 1 to change Primary to Potency and 1 for Advanced Potency so there's no Paradox either.<br /> [\u2026]<br /> Once the one-way Scrying window is open he can pretty much nuke to his heart's content. </div> </div> </div>Instant casting and Advanced Duration are going to be needed to get much use out of the window, particularly if you're going to be casting other spells sympathetically instead of remotely.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> A starting Mastigos can pretty much Scry on anyone he's met if he takes Matter as a third Arcana to move ink on a page to make a representation of his own memories. </div> </div> </div>A starting Mastigos can't put any of their free dots into Matter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T10:21:30-08:00","id":1159037,"title":"","content":"Advanced Potency doesn\u2019t reduce the chances of Paradox.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T10:34:24-08:00","id":1159050,"title":"","content":"See my edit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1470-johnny-awesome","name":"Johnny Awesome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1470_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"447"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T10:37:01-08:00","id":1159051,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1159002-sympathetic-casting-too-easy?p=1159035#post1159035\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Casual acquaintances aren't quite the same thing as random people on the street or even people you happen to know, and using secondhand sympathies takes up another spell.<br /> <br /> Instant casting and Advanced Duration are going to be needed to get much use out of the window, particularly if you're going to be casting other spells sympathetically instead of remotely.<br /> <br /> A starting Mastigos can't put any of their free dots into Matter.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're right Satchel. Thanks. Yeah, you'd need the extra Reach for Instant, but you have 4 Reach anyway so it won't really matter. I forgot about Inferior Arcana restrictions. Thanks.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1470,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1470-johnny-awesome","user":"Johnny Awesome","date":". 11-15-2017, 01:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1470-johnny-awesome","name":"Johnny Awesome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1470_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"447"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T10:41:07-08:00","id":1159057,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I would be a little stricter on your definition of 'Casual Acquaintance.' I usually class that as someone you have met 3+ times before, and have shared at least several conversations with in the recent past. Might seem a little strict, but it should lead to more intriguing gameplay, where the Space mage has to either use Borrow Threads (more plates to juggle) or use other magic/low cunning to get hold of some object belonging to the target he can use as a link. I adore the notion of Space specialists keeping folders/safes/secret cupboards full of potential links to strategically interesting people and places 'just in case.'<br /> <br /> Also bear in mind each use of the Sympathetic Range Attainment costs a Mana and swallows a Yantra slot without providing a mechanical bonus. My Mastigos Player was eternally running out of Mana and being forced to scour because of his frequent use of Sympathetic spells.<br /> <br /> Final point, in your example the PC has burnt a WP and still only comes out with a pool of 4 dice. In an 8+ dice system you will be surprised how often that fails.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6230-katana1515","name":"Katana1515","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"280"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T10:43:03-08:00","id":1159058,"title":"","content":"Well it fails 25% of the time.<br /> <br /> I will say that I've probably been too loose in my definition of Weak sympathy, so that would probably help.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1470,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1470-johnny-awesome","user":"Johnny Awesome","date":". 11-15-2017, 01:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1470-johnny-awesome","name":"Johnny Awesome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1470_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"447"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T13:42:13-08:00","id":1159158,"title":"","content":"Something also worth remembering is that, unless you're already sympathetically connected to the target, you need to cast Borrow Threads to borrow the sympathy, as Katana said. So that means that you're casting and maintaining two spells, before you cast any others. If you're Gnosis 1, that means you're casting with +2 Reach automatically applied to any spell you cast over your limit. Only when you reach Gnosis 3 can you start casting through a scrying window &quot;normally&quot;, and that's before you include the +1 Reach for casting through a scrying window.<br /> <br /> So let's say you're trying to read someone's mind through a scrying window as a starter Mage. You're looking at +1 for instant, +1 for visual range, +1 for through a viewing window, and +2 for the spells you're holding onto already. Even if you have Mind 3, you're going to be eating two Paradox, and that goes up by +1 for each dot the spell's requirement goes up. Given that the target's Withstand rating is also (Highest + 1) here, you're also going to be running the risk of your casting failing, due to simple lack of dice. Every time you need to cast another spell, of course, the Paradox pool goes up by +1.<br /> <br /> Suffice to say, sympathetic casting is possible, but it's not <i>easy</i>. By the time a Mage can do it &quot;easily&quot;, it's still not free.<br /> <br /> Still, generally speaking, you don't want Mages to feel weak. A big chunk of the game is &quot;Power and what you do with it&quot;. A Mage having the power to make someone do something or spy on people from a great distance... That's all meant to be something they can <i>do, </i>and the fun is in the consequences of their choices. It is for me, at least.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2855,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","user":"Axelgear","date":". 11-15-2017, 05:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T16:42:44-08:00","id":1159253,"title":"","content":"It's pretty situational. You're saying that the Mage starts with Gnosis 3, knows the sympathetic name of whoever he wants to Scry on (if he doesn't then that's a +1 to Withstand), and that he'll take Matter at some point (because a Mastigos can't take it at character creation). It also wouldn't be wise to use Willpower for every spell. Plus, Scrying is two dots, so at Space 3 that's two free Reach, taken up by Instant and Sensory already (unless you want to ritual cast), then Advanced Duration and swap Primary Factor. Either way, that's Paradox, not something you should just be doing willy nilly, even if you spend Mana or use your Dedicated Tool to beat it down. Then casting through a Scrying window itself is automatically two Reach, to go to Sensory and then Remote range, so chances are that spell will have that Paradox to contend with on top of a +1 from your prior Paradox roll, and then a +2 if he does it again, then a +3, and so on. So probably not nuking to his heart's content. A lot of things <i>seem </i>easy, but once you take into account other details and the circumstances it turns out to be more involved. And as the others said, you do actually need the sympathy yourself. I wouldn't worry about it being too easy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18038-traffichazard","name":"TrafficHazard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18038_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}